PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/admin/users/5
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user"
}

### Delete User (soft delete)
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/admin/users/5
Authorization: {{token}}

