### API Version
POST  {{BASE_URL}}/cart
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id" : 1,
  "varian_id" : 1,
  "size_id" : 1,
  "quantity" : 1
}

### get history
GET {{BASE_URL}}/transactions/history
Authorization: {{token}}